# The surface theme, sixty seconds — the window the console's hosted bench ran.
#
# 3601 ticks is what `zig build hostedbench` sends for EXCERPT $3C, counted in
# the SNES's own 60.0988 Hz frames. Its thirty-second sibling is the window
# `audiocost` and `audioload` measure over; this one exists so the offline load
# figure and the console's cover the same music.
